'''Noah Wallace''' (born July 6, 1991) is an American [[freestyle skiing|freestyle skier]]. He won a bronze medal in Slopestyle at the [[FIS Freestyle Ski and Snowboarding World Championships 2015]].<ref>{{cite web|title=Russ Henshaw wins slopestyle silver medal at snowboard and freestyle skiing world championships |url=http://www.abc.net.au/news/2015-01-22/russ-henshaw-wins-slopestyle-silver-medal-at-snowboard-and-free/6033846 |accessdate=3 February 2015}}</ref><ref name=fisprofile>{{cite web |title=FIS profile Noah Wallace |url=http://www.fis-ski.com/freestyle-skiing/halfpipe-slopestyle/athletes/athlete=wallace-noah-185754/ |accessdate=3 February 2015 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150330155454/http://www.fis-ski.com/freestyle-skiing/halfpipe-slopestyle/athletes/athlete=wallace-noah-185754/ |archive-date=30 March 2015 |url-status=dead }}</ref>

